WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:11.998
Think of a function as a machine: give it an input, follow its rule, and get one

00:00:11.998 --> 00:00:12.658
output.

00:00:15.458 --> 00:00:24.434
For f of x equals two x plus three, an input of four gives two times four plus three,

00:00:24.434 --> 00:00:26.546
which equals eleven.

00:00:29.346 --> 00:00:34.434
The domain is the set of inputs the machine accepts.
